{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startServerCommunication","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"startServerCommunication","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)startServerCommunication","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"title":"startServerCommunication"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/startServerCommunication","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"startServerCommunication"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts or resumes communication with Pushwoosh servers. This allows the SDK to send and receive"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data including device registration, tags, push tokens, and analytics.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Call this method after the user has consented to data collection, or to re-enable","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"communication after it was previously stopped.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enable communication after GDPR consent:"}]},{"code":["class ConsentManager {","","    func handleUserConsent(accepted: Bool) {","        if accepted {","            \/\/ User accepted data collection","            Pushwoosh.configure.startServerCommunication()","","            \/\/ Register for push after consent","            Pushwoosh.configure.registerForPushNotifications()","","            \/\/ Sync any pending user data","            syncPendingUserData()","","            Logger.info(\"User consented - Pushwoosh communication enabled\")","        } else {","            \/\/ User declined - disable communication","            Pushwoosh.configure.stopServerCommunication()","            Logger.info(\"User declined - Pushwoosh communication disabled\")","        }","","        UserDefaults.standard.set(accepted, forKey: \"gdprConsent\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"called "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopServerCommunication"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enables communication with Pushwoosh servers."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/startservercommunication"]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","abstract":[]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/startServerCommunication":{"type":"topic","title":"startServerCommunication","abstract":[{"text":"Enables communication with Pushwoosh servers.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"startServerCommunication"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/startServerCommunication","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"startServerCommunication","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/startservercommunication"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","role":"collection","title":"PushwooshCore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic"}}}